H. K. D. H. Bhadeshia. Bainite in Steels, third edition, 2015. [Author-associated free editions and primary research](https://www.phase-trans.msm.cam.ac.uk/bainite.html) · [Institutional repository and rights](https://www.repository.cam.ac.uk/handle/1810/262415).

Read the whole third edition for sustained advanced study, including mechanisms, thermodynamics, kinetics, crystallography, alloy design, characterization, properties, competing interpretations, and original references. Derive representative results and compare them with independent evidence. A monograph's depth in one transformation does not replace the wider metallurgy programme.

The author page offers free English downloads and distinguishes earlier editions from a separately sold Chinese translation. The institutional repository describes all-rights-reserved status. Free access is therefore distinguished from an unrestricted reuse licence. Edition, availability, and rights route checked on 29 October 2026. No monograph, images, or research collection is copied here.

